@finalize
title: Finalise the cabinet allocation
subtitle: Unspent leverage becomes coalition goodwill.
choose-if: ministry_count >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A governing Lewica delegation must take at least one portfolio.
on-arrival: {!
const portfolioNames = [
    "labor", "equality", "housing", "health", "digital", "science",
    "interior", "finance", "economy", "justice", "foreign",
    "agriculture", "defence"
];
Q.ministry_count = portfolioNames.reduce(function(total, portfolio) {
    return total +
        (Q[portfolio + "_minister_party"] == "Lewica" ? 1 : 0);
}, 0);
Q.ministries_finalized = 1;
if (
    Q.ministry_return_mode == "card_finish" ||
    Q.ministry_return_mode == "event_queue"
) {
    Q.government_coalition_dissent -=
        Math.floor(Q.ministry_leverage / 3);
    Q.news_headline =
        "The reshuffle leaves Lewica with " +
        Q.ministry_count + " cabinet portfolios";
} else {
    Q.ko_coalition_dissent -= Math.floor(Q.ministry_leverage / 2);
    Q.news_headline =
        "Lewica takes " + Q.ministry_count + " cabinet portfolios";
}
Q.ministry_leverage = 0;
Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "settled";
!}
go-to: poland_card_finish if ministry_return_mode = "card_finish"; poland_event_queue if ministry_return_mode = "event_queue"; poland_government_formation.governing_agreement if ministry_return_mode = "governing_agreement"; poland_government_formation.cabinet_program if ministry_return_mode != "card_finish" and ministry_return_mode != "event_queue" and ministry_return_mode != "governing_agreement"

@opposition_allocation
title: Confidence without ministries
new-page: true
on-arrival: ministries_finalized = 1; ministry_count = 0; ministry_leverage = 0; ministry_allocation_mode = "settled"

= No ministries

Lewica promised confidence and supply, not cabinet service. The coalition
allocates every portfolio without it: KO keeps the senior state and diplomatic
offices, Poland 2050 its institutional claims, and PSL Agriculture and Defence.

- @poland_government_formation.cabinet_program: Continue to the exposé
